WEBVTT

40:01.223 --> 40:03.725
Hannah!
Hey, Hannah!

40:03.976 --> 40:05.935
-What?
-Did I get my package in the mail?

40:06.020 --> 40:08.438
-I don't know.
-What do you mean you don't know?

40:08.522 --> 40:10.315
I don't know!

40:11.150 --> 40:14.110
-Oh, no, Hannah! Look, Janie!
-What? Hey!

40:14.195 --> 40:15.987
-She's sick!
-No, she's not!

40:16.072 --> 40:18.531
I'll have to perform
one of my operations.

40:18.616 --> 40:21.242
-No!
-No, not Sid's room. Not there.

40:21.327 --> 40:23.203
Hey, give her back!

40:23.287 --> 40:25.121
Sid! Sid!

40:26.040 --> 40:29.334
Oh, no, we have
a sick patient here, nurse.

40:29.418 --> 40:31.377
Prepare the OR, stat!
